# Public halves of the Ed25519 key pairs allowed to sign FinchGram releases, one hex key per line.
# Built into the app (src/update.rs); the private half is the RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY secret of the
# release workflow (src/bin/finchgram-release-sign.rs). To rotate: add the new key, ship a
# version, then remove the old one.
